      "translation": {
        "english_text": "Come! Come! Come! This is a tiger! Don’t think it’s a live tiger; it’s a dead tiger!... They say the people couldn’t bear the havoc this tiger caused, so they all ran to the zamindar and complained. At once the zamindar took his gun! Went to the forest!... Killed the tiger! Brought the head back and hung it here!...",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": []
      }
    },
