      "translation": {
        "english_text": "You’re rushing before I finish—the father of this zamindar’s father, that is, his grandfather!... Here, a deer’s head!... The present zamindar is very clever at deer hunting!... Deer that run at a hundred miles an hour—our zamindar goes at a hundred and fifty miles an hour, hunts them down and fells them!... Come!",
        "mode": "prose-faithful",
        "notes": []
